{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf023:l033", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 23, "folio": 406, "line_in_page": 33, "raw": "Сорко оозу болгон пенде көп,", "text": "Сорко оозу болгон пенде көп,", "en": "Many people had a Sorko-like mouth,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Сорко is a provisional proper-name or epithet reading; the line may continue semantically onto the next page.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Суурчулган менен хан Текүр,", "text": "Суурчулган менен хан Текүр,", "en": "Suurchulgan and Khan Tekür,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Both names are provisional readings of pale, joined handwriting; the second may have a different final vowel.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Кара түйкө манаткан,", "text": "Кара түйкө манаткан,", "en": "Who appointed the Kara Tüyкө,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "түйкө and манаткан are best-effort visual readings; the phrase may contain a title or ethnonym.", "bbox": null}
