{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Убу карагут кайрагын,", "text": "Убу карагут кайрагын,", "en": "The whetstone of this Karagut,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "карагут and кайрагын are provisional; the first may be a proper name and the English is contextual.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Алча жери кем эле,", "text": "Алча жери кем эле,", "en": "His Alcha land was lacking,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Алча may be a place-name; the first two words are pale and the translation is provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Дүйшөмүк пайдадан,", "text": "Дүйшөмүк пайдадан,", "en": "From Düyshömük's benefit,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The apparent proper name Дүйшөмүк is faint and may instead be an inflected common noun.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Кудай берсин көргөзбө,", "text": "Кудай берсин көргөзбө,", "en": "May God grant it—do not show it,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The imperative көргөзбө is the closest reading, but the faint final letters permit alternatives.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Аңга-мыңга чабан жан,", "text": "Аңга-мыңга чабан жан,", "en": "A shepherd soul amid beasts and thousands,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Аңга-мыңга is a visual approximation of an unclear paired expression; English is deliberately literal.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Жүрөгү суу коркоктор,", "text": "Жүрөгү суу коркоктор,", "en": "Cowards whose hearts are water,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Айла билбес төрчөлөр,", "text": "Айла билбес төрчөлөр,", "en": "Little lords who know no stratagem,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "төрчөлөр is a provisional reading of the joined final word and may be a different plural noun.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Караан болбой өлөр деп,", "text": "Караан болбой өлөр деп,", "en": "Saying he would die with no support,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "өлөр is inferred from the pale joined letters; the manuscript form may differ.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Кайрылгыс чын майдан,", "text": "Кайрылгыс чын майдан,", "en": "The true battlefield from which none turns back,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Кайрылгыс is contextually normalized from faint strokes that resemble кайрылгасыз.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Туруп жербай көргөн деп,", "text": "Туруп жербай көргөн деп,", "en": "Saying he stood and saw without yielding,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "жербай is the closest visual reading but is not securely resolved; English follows the apparent context.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Кайраты кем жамандар,", "text": "Кайраты кем жамандар,", "en": "Wretches whose courage is scant,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Башы курак, буту айры,", "text": "Башы курак, буту айры,", "en": "Their heads patched, their legs splayed,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "курак is visually plausible; the line appears proverbial and the English is literal.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Көп билбеген жамандар,", "text": "Көп билбеген жамандар,", "en": "Wretches who know little,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Миң жамандан бир жакшы,", "text": "Миң жамандан бир жакшы,", "en": "One good man is worth a thousand bad,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Караңкы жолтон жары жакшы,", "text": "Караңкы жолтон жары жакшы,", "en": "On a dark road, light is good,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "жолтон is the apparent manuscript form, possibly a dialectal or nonstandard form of жолдо; translation gives the evident sense.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Кайраттуу жолтон күр жакшы,", "text": "Кайраттуу жолтон күр жакшы,", "en": "On the courageous path, ardor is good,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "жолтон and күр are provisional readings; the parallel with the preceding line guides the English.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Кайрангача жайын көргөн деп,", "text": "Кайрангача жайын көргөн деп,", "en": "Saying he had seen its state to the bitter end,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Кайрангача and the idiomatic force of the line are provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Оң жагында Мункара,", "text": "Оң жагында Мункара,", "en": "At his right side was Munkara,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Мункара is treated as a proper name; its medial letters are faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Мункарасын сураба,", "text": "Мункарасын сураба,", "en": "Do not ask about his Munkara,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Мункарасын likely repeats the preceding proper name, but the intended referent is unresolved.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Эшигине кат койгон,", "text": "Эшигине кат койгон,", "en": "He placed a letter at his door,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Ири-мүйрү чакырып,", "text": "Ири-мүйрү чакырып,", "en": "Calling out, 'Iri-müyrü,'", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Ири-мүйрү is a provisional rendering of an indistinct paired expression or name.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Аңсайын деп ат койгон,", "text": "Аңсайын деп ат койгон,", "en": "He gave the name Angsayyn,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Аңсайын is a tentative proper-name reading; the initial and medial strokes are especially pale.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Аты койгон себеби,", "text": "Аты койгон себеби,", "en": "The reason he gave that name,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Эрендин сынган айтууга,", "text": "Эрендин сынган айтууга,", "en": "Was to speak of the hero's breaking,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "сынган is the closest visible form; syntax and English remain provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Ээ билбеген жамандар,", "text": "Ээ билбеген жамандар,", "en": "Wretches who know no master,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Тындым кылып колуна,", "text": "Тындым кылып колуна,", "en": "Making it still in his hand,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Тындым is a best-effort reading and may be a different inflected form; translation is literal.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Тыйнымын баздан сөзүнө,", "text": "Тыйнымын баздан сөзүнө,", "en": "Its restraint lay in Bazdan's word,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "баздан may be a proper name or a misread common word; the whole construction is faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Балбандары башкача,", "text": "Балбандары башкача,", "en": "His champions were extraordinary,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l032", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 32, "raw": "Жөрмө кылган жамандан,", "text": "Жөрмө кылган жамандан,", "en": "From the wretch who acted in a makeshift way,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Жөрмө is a provisional reading of the faint first word; the idiomatic sense is unclear.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf024:l033", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 24, "folio": 407, "line_in_page": 33, "raw": "Капкагысынан далайы,", "text": "Капкагысынан далайы,", "en": "Many of them from his onslaught,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Капкагысынан is a tentative reading of the final faint baseline; the clause continues beyond the page.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Адамзат мүнөзү курдашы,", "text": "Адамзат мүнөзү курдашы,", "en": "A companion of human character,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The pale joined words after Адамзат are provisionally read мүнөзү курдашы; the English follows that reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Тумшо кынын таянган,", "text": "Тумшо кынын таянган,", "en": "Tumesho leaned upon his scabbard,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Тумшо is a provisional proper-name reading; кынын is visually plausible but faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Жумушуңуз адам болгон,", "text": "Жумушуңуз адам болгон,", "en": "Your task concerned a man,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The opening word is a best visual reading; the line's syntax is provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Жумушу жок турган жан,", "text": "Жумушу жок турган жан,", "en": "A soul standing there without a task,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Ойбой бураң калбаган,", "text": "Ойбой бураң калбаган,", "en": "Alas, no bend remained,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "бураң is a tentative visual reading and the idiomatic sense is unresolved.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Байтаак бир балбан бар,", "text": "Байтаак бир балбан бар,", "en": "There is a mighty wrestler,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Байтаак is visually plausible; English renders it contextually as an epithet.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Кылыч алган өңдүү бар,", "text": "Кылыч алган өңдүү бар,", "en": "There is one who looks as though he took up a sword,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle word is faint and read алган provisionally.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Найза кармаган ат бузган,", "text": "Найза кармаган ат бузган,", "en": "He grasped a spear and broke the horses' formation,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final phrase appears to be ат бузган; English supplies the likely martial sense.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Чаркыраган мылтыгы бар,", "text": "Чаркыраган мылтыгы бар,", "en": "He has a flashing gun,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Бөрүдөй өңү кандуу бар,", "text": "Бөрүдөй өңү кандуу бар,", "en": "There is one whose bloodied face is wolf-like,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The tightly joined middle phrase is read өңү кандуу provisionally.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Алдагы болгон заары кур,", "text": "Алдагы болгон заары кур,", "en": "That one's venom was fierce,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "заары кур is a pale, provisional reading; English gives the apparent contextual sense.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Ажыдаардай заардуу бар,", "text": "Ажыдаардай заардуу бар,", "en": "There is one venomous as a dragon,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Хан эмине чок түзөк,", "text": "Хан эмине чок түзөк,", "en": "Khan, what fiery lowland is this?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The line is especially difficult; чок түзөк is only a visual approximation and the translation is conjectural.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Башын күрөр эт көргөн,", "text": "Башын күрөр эт көргөн,", "en": "Having seen flesh, he would sever the head,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "күрөр is a provisional reading of a corrected, heavily joined word.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Ташка эмине кылмат!", "text": "Ташка эмине кылмат!", "en": "What would he not do to stone!", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The opening word appears to be Ташка; punctuation follows the emphatic manuscript mark.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Башын күрөр көп көргөн,", "text": "Башын күрөр көп көргөн,", "en": "He had often seen heads severed,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "күрөр is uncertain; English is contextual rather than literal.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Куппа жакын эмине,", "text": "Куппа жакын эмине,", "en": "What is so very near?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Куппа is a best visual approximation; the line's sense remains unresolved.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Ажыдаардан кемиңиз,", "text": "Ажыдаардан кемиңиз,", "en": "You are no less than a dragon,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The ending is faint and provisionally read as second-person respectful кемиңиз.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Азар кайсан чалгындай,", "text": "Азар кайсан чалгындай,", "en": "Like a cutting blow from Azar Kaysan,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Азар кайсан may be a proper name or a different joined phrase; чалгындай is also provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Ат десе миниши салгындай,", "text": "Ат десе миниши салгындай,", "en": "At the word 'horse,' his riding seemed ready to launch,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The ending салгындай is a close visual reading; the English remains contextual.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Бошоно миңди коргундай,", "text": "Бошоно миңди коргундай,", "en": "As though Boshono could defend a thousand,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Бошоно is treated as a provisional name; коргундай is faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Кабылганы өрчүлдөй,", "text": "Кабылганы өрчүлдөй,", "en": "The one he encountered seemed fierce,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "өрчүлдөй is a visual approximation; translation gives the apparent sense.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Кез болгону соргундай,", "text": "Кез болгону соргундай,", "en": "Whoever met him seemed doomed,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final word is provisionally read соргундай; English is contextual.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Кабылганды кул кылып,", "text": "Кабылганды кул кылып,", "en": "Enslaving whoever encountered him,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "кул is pale but fits the visible letters and syntax.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Жерге жанган койгундай,", "text": "Жерге жанган койгундай,", "en": "As though setting the burned one upon the ground,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "жанган is a tentative reading; the phrase and translation remain unresolved.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Эр сыман мунара,", "text": "Эр сыман мунара,", "en": "A tower like a hero,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "мунара is visually likely but the metaphor may depend on following lines.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Мунаранын арабы,", "text": "Мунаранын арабы,", "en": "The Arab of the tower,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The second word appears to be арабы, though its sense is unclear.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Мунаранын түбүндө,", "text": "Мунаранын түбүндө,", "en": "At the foot of the tower,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Жалгыз ак үй төмөнтүр,", "text": "Жалгыз ак үй төмөнтүр,", "en": "A lone white yurt stands below,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final word is read төмөнтүр provisionally; English smooths the construction.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Жолу болгон эки хан,", "text": "Жолу болгон эки хан,", "en": "Two khans whose paths met,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle phrase is pale; translation is contextual.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Жолоп адам келбедиби?", "text": "Жолоп адам келбедиби?", "en": "Did no traveler come?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Жолоп is a provisional reading; it may be another participial form.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l032", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 32, "raw": "Бастырып бир жан баратат,", "text": "Бастырып бир жан баратат,", "en": "Someone is riding along at a steady pace,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final verb is faint and normalized only to the closest visible reading баратат.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf025:l033", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 25, "folio": 408, "line_in_page": 33, "raw": "Бул баатыр Каракан,", "text": "Бул баатыр Каракан,", "en": "This hero is Karakhan,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final name is read Каракан provisionally; the line may continue syntactically on the next folio.", "bbox": null}
